$Notes:
Short Release observation fixture. The player is protected, support is
available on demand, and an external cargo container remains outside the
Phase 2 support/docking closure. The real product loads the mission and
publishes the representative CompleteShip state without scripted catalog
mutations.
$End Notes:

$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("Request support, target External Cargo 1, and remain in mission for the CompleteShip observation.", -1)
